          "name": "Gather 1.0 is unchanged. Fieldwork is a separate candidate. Photo",
          "fill": "$fw/muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Fieldwork replaces Gather as the selected baseline. Keep the licensed reference photo and its notice. Geist and Fraunces use Pen font support; native bundling and shaping remain qualification gates.",
