          "name": "Independent review and correction record",
          "fill": "$fw/muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Gemini Argon reviewed the interaction research; the parent applied its accepted findings and the user’s dropdown correction. The expanded catalogue receives parent structural and visual checks. New catalogue counts and saved-file evidence live in design/fieldwork-system/manifest.json.",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$fw/body",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "hCcDO",
          "name": "Pen dimension qualification",
          "fill": "$fw/muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Pen’s renderer dropped variable-valued button heights during creation. Control masters now use explicit numeric 36 / 48 px dimensions and were checked by resolved bounds. Semantic size tokens remain the implementation contract; canvas sizes are not falsely described as live-bound.",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$fw/body",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
